        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D Side-Scrolling Roguelike Action RPG with Online PvP<strong>.</strong><br><br><br>Explore procedurally generated dungeons in Deadly Wonderland. Collect new weapons, shields, and companions as you venture deeper into the dungeon. Discover a wide variety of items and enemies, and even recruit defeated enemies as companions. Upgrade your equipment and recruit stronger companions to reach even deeper floors.<br><br>Enjoy three unique modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PSI Masquerade</strong> – A versus mode where you fight using randomly assigned psychic powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transrealm Masquerade</strong> – A versus mode where you can bring in your own gear and companion characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Wonderland</strong> – A roguelike action game that can be played both online and offline.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Play Solo</strong>  <br>In <i>Deadly Wonderland</i>, when no other players are available, a bot companion will join you. A fully offline mode is also available.  <br>In Versus modes, if there are too few players, you can add bot opponents. In “Offline Battle Training,” you can battle against bots under the same rules as actual matches.  <br> <br><strong>Or with Many Players</strong>  <br><i>Deadly Wonderland</i> supports up to 3 players in co-op. Versus modes allow up to 6 players to battle at once.   <br>  <br>  Use the companion web app to receive notifications when other players log in.<br><br><strong>★Premium Unlock</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Steam version, the following features are included in the base price and unlocked from the start.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angel Realm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devil Realm</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Costume Parts:  Cat Set, Dog Set, Rabbit Set, Fox Set<br><br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758810/extras/1f0b4e5368baa0bce1d554211089e8aa.avif?t=1783584984\" width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D Side-Scrolling Roguelike Action RPG with Online PvP<strong>.</strong><br><br><br>Explore procedurally generated dungeons in Deadly Wonderland. Collect new weapons, shields, and companions as you venture deeper into the dungeon. Discover a wide variety of items and enemies, and even recruit defeated enemies as companions. Upgrade your equipment and recruit stronger companions to reach even deeper floors.<br><br>Enjoy three unique modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PSI Masquerade</strong> – A versus mode where you fight using randomly assigned psychic powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transrealm Masquerade</strong> – A versus mode where you can bring in your own gear and companion characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Wonderland</strong> – A roguelike action game that can be played both online and offline.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Play Solo</strong>  <br>In <i>Deadly Wonderland</i>, when no other players are available, a bot companion will join you. A fully offline mode is also available.  <br>In Versus modes, if there are too few players, you can add bot opponents. In “Offline Battle Training,” you can battle against bots under the same rules as actual matches.  <br> <br><strong>Or with Many Players</strong>  <br><i>Deadly Wonderland</i> supports up to 3 players in co-op. Versus modes allow up to 6 players to battle at once.   <br>  <br>  Use the companion web app to receive notifications when other players log in.<br><br><strong>★Premium Unlock</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Steam version, the following features are included in the base price and unlocked from the start.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angel Realm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devil Realm</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Costume Parts:  Cat Set, Dog Set, Rabbit Set, Fox Set<br><br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758810/extras/1f0b4e5368baa0bce1d554211089e8aa.avif?t=1783584984\" width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p></li></ul>",
